  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "A new order behind the leaders",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-jean-francois-puget-identity-0"
      ],
      "text": "nvbanana closes third at 81.39, ahead of rabbithole’s unchanged 80.83 in fourth. The observed score event moves nvbanana from 79.72 and fourth to 81.39 and third. Its fresh roster lists cpmpml, the verified account of Jean-François Puget, and darraghdog. This is the ARC-AGI-2 entry; NVARC3 is a separate ARC-AGI-3 team. The event establishes the recorded step, while the helper withholds a complete midnight-to-close comparison for nvbanana."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The chase still has distance to cover",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-yi-chia-chen-identity-0",
        "person-dawid-kopiczko-identity-0"
      ],
      "text": "Tufa Labs remains first at 88.06 and Yi-Chia Chen second at 84.72, both unchanged against the midnight comparison. nvbanana is now 3.33 behind Chen. Its third-place move sharpens the pursuit, but neither leader lost a place overnight. Majkel1337 holds fifth at 75.56 and Dawid Kopiczko sixth at 75.14."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Movement further down the field",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-22-2142-arc-2-lee-minseung-gains-to-37th"
      ],
      "text": "The overnight wire recorded Lee Minseung’s rise from 43rd to 37th, with a 4.59-point increase to 50.42 in its day-long window. Later recorded events include Yuvraj #2 moving from 92nd to 42nd at 47.08 and Aneesh & Yash from 34th to 30th at 55.97. These are dated observed steps, rather than a claim that each rank is still the closing rank. The provisional gold score remains 66.53, unchanged against midnight, so those results still leave ground to cover."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Steady scores can still lose places",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "ARC Raiders remains 13th at 68.75. ARC Mutants falls two places to 64th at an unchanged 39.31, and Mithil A Vakde falls one to 104th at an unchanged 33.89. The field is advancing around those entries. All medal bands are provisional. Social and discussion research was not refreshed for this edition; the report uses the board feed and saved reporting archive."
    }
  ],
